{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"null\" initial=\"s\">\n  <state id=\"s\">\n    <transition event=\"go\" cond=\"x &gt; 1\" target=\"f\"/>\n    <onentry><send event=\"e\" delayexpr=\"late\"/></onentry>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"f\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-expressions.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":2},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-expressions.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":4,"byteOffset":72,"endColumn":77,"endLine":1,"startColumn":73,"startLine":1},"insertedContent":{"text":"ecmascript"}}]}],"description":{"text":"select the ECMAScript data model"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-expressions.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":43,"endLine":3,"startColumn":28,"startLine":3}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`cond` on `<transition>` is not an `In('stateID')` predicate, the only condition the null data model supports\n\n**Note:** the null data model has no data, value expressions, location expressions, or scripts; conditions may only be `In('stateID')`, with the state ID quoted\n\n**Help:** rewrite the condition as `In('stateID')`, or select a data model that supports it, such as `datamodel=\"ecmascript\"`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §B.1 The Null Data Model","text":"`cond` on `<transition>` is not an `In('stateID')` predicate, the only condition the null data model supports"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":150,"start":135},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"the null data model is selected here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-expressions.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":77,"endLine":1,"startColumn":73,"startLine":1}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML079"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-expressions.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":17,"byteOffset":192,"endColumn":46,"endLine":4,"startColumn":29,"startLine":4},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove `delayexpr`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}},{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-expressions.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":4,"byteOffset":72,"endColumn":77,"endLine":1,"startColumn":73,"startLine":1},"insertedContent":{"text":"ecmascript"}}]}],"description":{"text":"select the ECMAScript data model"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-expressions.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":46,"endLine":4,"startColumn":30,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"the null data model defines no value-expression language, but `<send>` uses `delayexpr`\n\n**Note:** the null data model has no data, value expressions, location expressions, or scripts; conditions may only be `In('stateID')`, with the state ID quoted\n\n**Help:** remove the expression, or select a data model that supports expressions, such as `datamodel=\"ecmascript\"`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §B.1 The Null Data Model","text":"the null data model defines no value-expression language, but `<send>` uses `delayexpr`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":209,"start":193},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"the null data model is selected here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-expressions.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":77,"endLine":1,"startColumn":73,"startLine":1}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML079"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML 1.0 §B.1: \"There is no location expression language.\", \"There is no value expression language.\", and the condition language \"consists of the In predicate only\" (`In('stateID')`, the ID quoted as a string). Any other expression is ill-formed there, and §5.9.4 lets the processor \"wait and place 'error.execution' in the internal event queue at runtime when the expressions are evaluated\", which this toolchain does (a condition is then false), so the document compiles"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: rewrite conditions as `In('stateID')` and remove the other expressions, or select a data model such as `ecmascript`.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §B.1 The Null Data Model\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML079` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#minimal-profile","id":"SCXML079","name":"SCXML079","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an expression is used under the null data model"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}